---
const APP_URL = "https://app.senseiherb.com";
---

<section class="relative py-32 px-5 overflow-hidden bg-grad-cta" aria-labelledby="cta-title">

  <!-- Glow ambiental -->
  <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-radial-[ellipse_60%_40%_at_50%_100%] from-dojo-card to-transparent opacity-60 pointer-events-none" aria-hidden="true" />

  <div class="relative z-10 flex flex-col items-center text-center gap-8 max-w-xl mx-auto">

    <!-- Logo Sensei -->
    <div class="relative flex items-center justify-center">
      <div class="absolute w-48 h-48 rounded-full bg-dojo-green/10 blur-3xl" aria-hidden="true" />
      <img
        src="/assets/sensei-logo.png"
        alt=""
        class="relative w-28 md:w-36 h-auto drop-shadow-[0_8px_48px_rgba(52,211,153,0.35)]"
        width="144"
        height="265"
        loading="lazy"
        aria-hidden="true"
      />
    </div>

    <div>
      <h2 id="cta-title" class="font-display font-black text-3xl md:text-5xl text-white leading-tight">
        El camino empieza<br />
        <span class="text-dojo-gold">con una semilla.</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="mt-4 text-dojo-muted text-lg">
        Únete a la comunidad. El conocimiento responsable del cannabis empieza aquí.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- CTA Google -->
    <a
      href={APP_URL}
      rel="noopener noreferrer"
      class="inline-flex items-center gap-3 h-14 px-8 rounded-2xl bg-white text-dojo-bg font-bold text-base shadow-xl transition-all hover:scale-105 hover:shadow-2xl active:scale-95 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-white focus-visible:outline-offset-2"
      aria-label="Acceder a SenseiHerb con Google"
    >
      <!-- Google logo -->
      <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
        <path fill="#4285F4" d="M22.56 12.25c0-.78-.07-1.53-.2-2.25H12v4.26h5.92c-.26 1.37-1.04 2.53-2.21 3.31v2.77h3.57c2.08-1.92 3.28-4.74 3.28-8.09z"/>
        <path fill="#34A853" d="M12 23c2.97 0 5.46-.98 7.28-2.66l-3.57-2.77c-.98.66-2.23 1.06-3.71 1.06-2.86 0-5.29-1.93-6.16-4.53H2.18v2.84C3.99 20.53 7.7 23 12 23z"/>
        <path fill="#FBBC05" d="M5.84 14.09c-.22-.66-.35-1.36-.35-2.09s.13-1.43.35-2.09V7.07H2.18C1.43 8.55 1 10.22 1 12s.43 3.45 1.18 4.93l3.66-2.84z"/>
        <path fill="#EA4335" d="M12 5.38c1.62 0 3.06.56 4.21 1.64l3.15-3.15C17.45 2.09 14.97 1 12 1 7.7 1 3.99 3.47 2.18 7.07l3.66 2.84c.87-2.6 3.3-4.53 6.16-4.53z"/>
      </svg>
      Continuar con Google
    </a>

    <p class="text-xs text-dojo-muted/50">
      Solo mayores de 18 años · Gratuito para empezar · Sin tarjeta
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
